30
00:02:37.896 --> 00:02:44.840
pickle. "Two cups of butter, no, one cup butter and one cup oil, no, that doesn’t sound right . .

31
00:02:44.841 --> 00:02:51.233
. Oh! I don’t know. I can’t remember!" Meg cried as she tried to recall the ingredients in apple

