51
00:04:27.862 --> 00:04:33.879
again. "Don’t say such things. That’s not true. Tell me how I can help," said

52
00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:38.647
Jo. Meg explained what she was doing and why things weren’t going as smoothly as she’d

53
00:04:38.648 --> 00:04:47.197
like. "I didn’t want to ask you or Mother since I knew Amy needed your help, and besides, I thought I could manage on my own," Meg

54
00:04:47.198 --> 00:04:54.239
said. "Why doesn’t John help you?" asked Jo, still looking for an excuse to dislike the man who had taken Meg away from

55
