64
00:05:45.823 --> 00:05:55.552
her clothes. With no sign of Jo, Meg anxiously tidied her small living room and set out the cutlery and china plates purchased with Aunt March's generous

65
00:05:55.553 --> 00:06:00.803
wedding gift. Then she paced the kitchen floor, her heart racing as her eyes skimmed the

66
