bare table. Meg was beginning to feel sorry for John, who would be coming home to find nothing ready for

67
00:06:06.714 --> 00:06:12.100
his guests, when her ears picked up the sounds of a horse trotting, then stopping in front of

68
00:06:12.101 --> 00:06:16.810
